  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Evaluate $f(t)=7u(t-1)$ at $t=-4,$ where $u$ is the unit step function.\n\n$f(t)=$\n{{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "The unit step function $u(t)$ is defined as\n\n$$\nu(t)={\\begin{aligned}1,\\,t\\ge 0, \\\\ 0,\\,t<0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating $f(t)$ at $t=-4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-4) & =7u(-4-1) \\\\  & =7u(-5) \\\\  & =7\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(-4)=0.$",
